  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://random-stuff.jakearchibald.com/bug-repros/dialog-in-popover-opener/\n\nWhen the popovers within the main popover are opened, the main popopver remains open. This happens even in the case where the `<div popover>` element is _not_ within the main popopver. This happens because it takes the activating button into consideration.\n\nHowever, in the same case with `<dialog>`, only the element's position in the DOM is considered, so the final button closes the parent popover.\n\nIt feels like all cases should leave the parent popover open.",
